course: dictionary
lesson: 6259
title: One word, two meanings
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Some words have more than one meaning, and the words around them show you which meaning the writer wants. Mollie is one of these words. Look at the context before you decide.
explain: «On Mother's Day Mollie's class makes cards.» Here Mollie is a name. A class is made of people, and a capital letter at the start of a name tells you it belongs to a person. Ask: does this fit a person or a thing? A girl's name fits here.
explain: A mollie can also be a small fish that lives in water, often kept in a home fish tank. Its spelling can be mollie or molly, so you cannot always tell from the spelling alone. You need the sentence to decide.
explain: Swap your meaning into the sentence and check it still makes sense. «Mollie makes one for Mum» makes sense with a name, but not with a fish, because a fish cannot make a card.
fact: A word can have more than one meaning, and context shows you which one is used.
fact: «Mollie» (name) is a girl's name, a pet form of Mary.
fact: «A mollie» (noun) is a small, lively freshwater fish often kept in home aquariums.
fact: Mollies are livebearers: the females give birth to live babies instead of laying eggs.
fact: In «Animal Farm», Mollie is a vain horse.
exercise: «On Mother's Day Mollie's class makes cards.» What does Mollie mean here? | A type of card | A kind of sunflower | A small, lively fish | *A girl's name
exercise: Mum's fish tank has a mollie in it. What is a mollie? | A horse on a farm | *A small, lively freshwater fish | A large brown bird | A type of sunflower
exercise: In «Mollie makes one for Mum», what tells you Mollie is a person? | *It has a capital M and does what a person does, like making a card | It is a fish that swims | It is a horse on a farm | It has a small m
test: Mollies are livebearers. What does that mean? | Mollies can sing | Mollies lay eggs in the sand | Mollies only live in the sea | *Mother mollies give birth to live babies
test: Which sentence uses mollie as a fish? | *The mollie swam round the tank | Mollie is at school today | Mollie wrote a card for Mum | Mollie is my best friend
exam: Which meaning fits in «Mollie makes one for Mum, with a sunflower»? | A small pink flower | A type of fish tank | *A girl's name | A fish that lays no eggs
